[Options]

[@1]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>Ok our scouts have found the Elementals!

[@2]
<p>Where are they?  ~l~IYou ask.

[@3]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>North East of here about 30 minutes.

[@4]
<h2>~yGovenor of Sun</h2>
<p>We aren't to get anywhere untill we get rid of these guards first!

[@5]
<h2>~gPage of Thunder</h2>
<p>Let's kill them and get out of here!

[@600]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>I have scouts telling us more enemie forces are headed this way!

[@601]
<h2>~yGovenor of Sun</h2>
<p>How are we going to attack the Elementals if we have to constantly engage the Elemental's forces?!

[@602]
<p>I'll leave you four to cover me while I attack the Elementals.

[@603]
<h2>~gPage of Thunder</h2>
<p>But milord!  You can't take all of them at the same time!

[@604]
<p>~l~IYou think for a moment but you know this can be the only way...With the Elemental's forces merging upon your location there is no way you and you allies can defeat them and survive the attacks from the aproaching army...
<p>~.~NThis is the only way we can ahieve victory....You still have enough power to last another day or two...but the fighting could last much longer.  The Elementals must fall now!

[@605]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>Look there is no reason to do this alone....The Duke was my friend as well but you face unimaginable odds!

[@606]
<p>I know...But I doubt that those three have enough power to hold off that many incoming forces....They have the experience true but they will need your support..

[@607]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>I truly hope you are right my friend....~I~gI just hope your lust for revenge has not utterly consumed you...

[A.]
<h2>Frontal Assault</h2>
<i>"You don't win battles by just defending."<br>
--Opanal Xanik, Nimbian General.</i>  
<p>With a hole in the perimeter defence you and your allies have launched a full scale frontal assualt on the Elementals.  Knowing that the Elementals have to spread their defences you have been able to dispatch many of their defenders will little trouble.  With the vast amount of storm power you have collected you will not have to retreat for days in end.  Still you must find and kill the Elementals before their forces can regroup. 
<p>After another day of fighting non-stop your forces have begun to slow down.  Scouts bring in information that may lead to the Elemental's base of operations.  News has not quite spread out about your attack...yet.  With the defences weakened you press on.
<p>Take out the remaining defences and prepare to take your revenge and destroy the only force now capable of taking control of all of Nimbus.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0


